      "compiled_statement": "\u2200 {d r : \u2115} (s : FreeEntropy.FixedSpectrum d r) (hd : 2 \u2264 d) (mu nu : Fin d \u2192 \u2115) (hmu : Antitone mu)\n  (hnu : Antitone nu),\n  (\u2200 (i : Fin d), r \u2264 \u2191i \u2192 mu i = 0) \u2192\n    (\u2200 (i : Fin d), r \u2264 \u2191i \u2192 nu i = 0) \u2192\n      \u2200 (hinc : Antitone fun (i : Fin d) => \u2191(nu i) - \u2191(mu i)) (U : \u21a5(Matrix.unitaryGroup (Fin d) \u2102)),\n        FreeEntropy.TraceDistance.traceDistance\n              (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.prvForward mu nu hmu hnu hinc\n                (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.canonicalOrbitState s mu U))\n              (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.canonicalOrbitState s nu U) \u2264\n            FreeEntropy.Theorem2.cloningConstant d r s.qx * \u2191(FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.differenceNorm mu nu) /\n              (\u2191(FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.minimumRowGap mu r hd \u22ef) + 1) \u2227\n          FreeEntropy.TraceDistance.traceDistance\n              (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.prvReverse mu nu hmu hnu hinc\n                (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.canonicalOrbitState s nu U))\n              (FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.canonicalOrbitState s mu U) \u2264\n            FreeEntropy.Theorem2.cloningConstant d r s.qx * \u2191(FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.differenceNorm mu nu) /\n              (\u2191(FreeEntropy.ExteriorRepresentation.minimumRowGap mu r hd \u22ef) + 1)",
